            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Browser security: Clickjacking admin. Categories: Clickjacking. Weaknesses: CWE-1021."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Browser security: Clickjacking admin. Categories: Clickjacking. Weaknesses: CWE-1021.\n\n## Remediation\n\nD\u00e9finir CSP frame-ancestors 'none' ou 'self' et X-Frame-Options DENY/SAMEORIGIN sur toutes les pages hors embed. Garder une exception explicite et \u00e9troite pour /embed/* et tester les en-t\u00eates de /admin, /sm et des widgets.",
                "text": "Browser security: Clickjacking admin. Categories: Clickjacking. Weaknesses: CWE-1021.\n\nRemediation:\n\nD\u00e9finir CSP frame-ancestors 'none' ou 'self' et X-Frame-Options DENY/SAMEORIGIN sur toutes les pages hors embed. Garder une exception explicite et \u00e9troite pour /embed/* et tester les en-t\u00eates de /admin, /sm et des widgets."
              },
              "id": "browser-security.clickjacking-admin",
              "name": "Browser security: Clickjacking admin",
